Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:09.00,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Nice serve, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.16,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Right on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:11.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.51,0:00:14.91,Default,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,Yuki looks good no matter what she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.46,Default,MALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,I can't believe she's the same age as us, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.56,Default,MALE STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,Yuki got another service ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:21.24,Default,MALE STUDENTS,0,0,0,,She's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:24.75,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,They've seen nothing yet. When Ms. Yuki \Ngets serious, she's on a whole other level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.07,0:00:28.13,Default,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,She's beautiful, smart, and athletic...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:30.71,Default,MALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,I can't see how she's related \Nto Hitoyoshi at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:34.26,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Well, I can't say I disagree, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:39.14,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I'm still feeling the high \Nfrom the movie-like experience I had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:41.99,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,where Ms. Yuki's life was in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:45.14,Flashback,GRACE {Flashback},0,0,0,,She was a ruthless murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:48.88,Flashback,GRACE {Flashback},0,0,0,,The fourth of the Dragon's Nine:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:50.90,Flashback,GRACE {Flashback},0,0,0,,Xue the White Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:53.82,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,I won't kill anyone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.82,Flashback,YUKI {flashback},0,0,0,,And I won't let anyone die \Nbecause of me, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.95,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\blur0.2\c&H6C6F6C&\frz24.53\pos(244.5,139.5)}Dragon's Nine      Assassination
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:00.95,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I still have far too many unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:06.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,But as Ms. Yuki continues in \Nher pursuit of normalcy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:09.96,Default,MALE STUDENTS,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.88,0:01:12.00,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fad(150,304)\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H6AC151&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(468.5,87.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.92,0:01:12.00,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fad(150,304)\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&HEA2D91&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(121.5,121.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.00,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fad(150,304)\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H4DA9E9&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(277.5,23.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.62,0:01:14.00,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's doing the best she can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&HE43493&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(48.5,214)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H6AC151&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(535,241.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H51ADF2&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(445.5,164)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&HF5C155&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(176.5,274)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&HF46447&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(145.5,7.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:16.86,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I won't let their jealousy and envy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:17.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\shad1\fs28\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H4333E1&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(365.5,50.5)}Stare
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.98,0:01:19.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,get to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.31,Default,MALE STUDENTS,0,0,0,,Hey, Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.02,0:01:27.64,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, man! That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.19,0:01:31.67,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,We'd be in big trouble if {\i1}you{\i0} \Ngot hurt now, wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.53,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Especially with you-know-who.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.53,0:01:38.49,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's not just because of Ms. Yuki \Nthat I'm being singled out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.99,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H561BE4&\3c&H572F8D&\bord1\frz28.33\pos(299,163)}Grin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.99,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H561BE4&\3c&H572F8D&\bord1\frz12.03\pos(306.5,46.5)}Grin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:42.99,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\c&H561BE4&\3c&H572F8D&\bord1\frz343.1\pos(597.5,52)}Grin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:42.99,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's a big part of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.46,0:03:16.84,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1C23D4&}6{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1C23D4&}You{\c&H000000&}'re Lonelier Than I Thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.82,0:03:16.84,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,How can I help you, Ms. Nitta?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.84,0:03:18.44,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.18,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It wouldn't kill you to be a little nicer \Nto helpless new teachers like myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.79,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:25.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.09,0:03:28.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Haven't you heard of personal space?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.06,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&HC42C78&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(92.5,280.5)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.06,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H3B2ABF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(97,116.5)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.06,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H3B71C7&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(433.5,7)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:34.31,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H9897A0&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(92.5,280.5)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:34.31,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H51535F&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(97,116.5)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.06,0:03:34.31,Signs,SCREEN CAP,0,0,0,,{\shad1\fs24\bord1\fnArial Black\c&H626562&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(433.5,7)}Jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:34.31,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And the reason why things have \Nbecome so complicated is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:39.54,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:40.36,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(193,1)\fs40\fnArial Black\c&H6020E3&\pos(507.5,57)}Meow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.54,0:03:40.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:41.50,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:45.34,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,How could you have already forgotten me \Nafter the passionate night we shared?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.34,0:03:47.28,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's me, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:50.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The setup here is that I'm \Nthe new gym teacher, Ms. Nitta—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:54.42,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,a big-sister figure related to you—\Nwho's just moved to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:57.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The way you look and talk \Nis completely different!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.80,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And that's way too many details!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:03.85,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,If Xue's specialty is "combat," \Nmine is "espionage."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:07.84,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'm especially good at disguises.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:09.81,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Besides, this is the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.13,0:04:13.73,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Or do you prefer girls with long, dark hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:15.19,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Just like your "Ms. Yuki."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.05,0:04:18.15,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?! No, that's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:22.01,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,It's written all over your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.01,0:04:23.71,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You're a funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:27.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I thought you'd had enough, \Nbut do you still have business with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.71,0:04:32.12,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You know, I just love having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.12,0:04:35.67,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,The legendary assassin, the great Xue,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:38.69,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,now serving under a civilian brat
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:41.38,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,and saying that she's given up \Nkilling on top of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:45.63,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'd never find {\i1}anything{\i0} that amusing \Nif I fled to the tropics!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:50.68,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,With that said, I have no intention of killing, \Nand even less of being killed myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.68,0:04:52.78,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,In other words, my hostility level is zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.78,0:04:56.11,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm not asking for you \Nto trust me for nothing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.02,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Let's negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:05:00.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,A negotiation between assassins...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.23,0:05:04.95,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,First of all, I'll no longer make any move \Non you or Hitoyoshi with killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.16,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,And furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.54,0:05:12.75,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I knew it! Is she about to offer untold riches \Nor super-secret info to sweeten the deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:17.58,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,For three months, I'll provide you \Nwith bread from the school store!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:20.48,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What, bread?! That's such \Na commoner thing to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.48,0:05:23.92,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,No, maybe it's some kind \Nof secret assassin code?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:28.39,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Of course, I'm not just talking about any \Nordinary bread here. What I'm offering...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:34.35,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,is Katsuda Bread! That's right, \Nall the Katsuda Bread you can eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.25,0:05:40.28,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Oh, she's in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.61,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,We have a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:49.29,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:53.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's strictly prohibited for us to kill \Nan ordinary person without cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:56.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And now that she understands \Nshe is no match for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.42,0:06:00.13,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,she has nothing to gain from \Nharming you, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:03.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,However, even if something \Nlike that were to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:07.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will protect... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wipe that drool, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:14.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And besides, I can handle second-rate \Nkillers like her by the thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.08,0:06:15.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There is no need for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:16.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.58,0:06:19.60,DefaultItalics,GRACE {M},0,0,0,,Dang... I've been downgraded to fodder tier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.35,0:06:22.01,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Well, anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:26.03,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll continue to observe you guys \Nquietly, so let's get along, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:29.78,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Or at least, that was the plan, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:33.62,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I never \Nreally liked gym class myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:37.74,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,But I figured the easiest jobs to slack \Noff during were this and school nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.74,0:06:40.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Weren't you going to observe us quietly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.05,0:06:43.07,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Aren't I whispering to you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:45.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Not right into my ear, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.18,0:06:47.71,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:51.39,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I think it's actually bothering her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:52.26,Default,FEMALE STUDENT1,0,0,0,,Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:54.05,Default,FEMALE STUDENT1,0,0,0,,Are you gonna serve or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:56.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right! My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:01.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Are you sure she's not just worried \Nabout you pulling something funny again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:03.90,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,You didn't notice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:05.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Notice what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.27,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.68,0:07:13.78,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,But, since you're the one asking...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.99,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,I'll tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.16,Default,GRACE,0,0,0,,everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.96,Default,STUDENTS {background},0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:31.97,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs36\fnArial Black}Now I've done it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:31.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.97,0:07:33.74,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,That was amazing, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:36.18,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 1,0,0,0,,It went straight through the net! \NYou're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.78,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 2,0,0,0,,Just who are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.52,Default,FEMALE STUDENT 3,0,0,0,,You want to join our club?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.09,0:07:39.52,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,Well... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.48,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:08:00.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-I really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.54,0:08:07.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, I know it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.14,0:08:12.01,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But... What happened, all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:20.51,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm not certain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:24.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I understand that Grace \Ndoesn't wish you harm, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:30.05,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Whenever I see you with \Nsomeone else from the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:33.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I feel this sense of alienation \Nfor some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:38.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is this, too, part of being normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.06,0:08:39.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Or is there...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.41,0:08:42.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,something wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.83,0:08:47.38,FlashbackItalics,GRACE {Flashback},0,0,0,,You didn't notice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.34,FlashbackItalics,GRACE {Flashback},0,0,0,,Didn't notice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:54.84,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\an7\c&H365538&\3c&H000000&\bord4}Ms. Yuki {\c&H2C264C&}Feeling {\c&H952464&}Jealousy\N{\c&H2C254D&}For The First Time
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.00,0:08:54.84,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\an7\c&H365538&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord2}Ms. Yuki {\c&H2C264C&}Feeling {\c&H952464&}Jealousy\N{\c&H2C254D&}For The First Time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:54.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um, it's normal to feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.19,0:09:01.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.60,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Mornin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:49.98,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:50.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The towel is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The towel is fluffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.04,0:09:58.16,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/N},0,0,0,,It's been a month since she started \Ntraining to wash towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:10:01.03,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/N},0,0,0,,One time, she mixed colored \Nand white towels together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:04.66,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/N},0,0,0,,Another, she put in dishwashing soap \Ninstead of laundry detergent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.66,0:10:07.05,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/N},0,0,0,,She even forgot to take out \Nthe tissues before washing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:08.92,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M/N},0,0,0,,She's overcome so many failures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You finally succeeded at doing the laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.13,0:10:14.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You've come so far, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:15.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:18.43,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're happy for her, too, aren't ya, Mochita?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:21.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:22.91,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm going to go fold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:36.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord1.5\move(412,304,411.5,332,26,2446)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:36.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.40,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What should we have for dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:41.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Dinner...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.45,0:10:44.16,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The only thing we have in \Nthe fridge is cabbage, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:46.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Cabbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:47.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Slicing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sliced cabbage...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.66,0:10:54.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And next to the sliced cabbage \Nwould be tonkatsu—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:58.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,or rather, we would need to reserve a space \Nfor Katsuda's Sauce! Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.71,0:10:58.38,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(403,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H71767A&\3c&HFAFDFD&}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:03.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Mrs. Fuku, two tonkatsu, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:04.72,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:11.69,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnArial Black\c&H1A2066&\3c&HC4BED2&}Katsuda Side Dish Store
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:07.17,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Thank you as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.17,0:11:11.69,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,They're almost done frying, \Nso could you wait a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.23,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:14.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.65,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.82,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Who's that beauty with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:22.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi. \NTh-There's Katsuda's Sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.48,0:11:24.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's so many boxes \Nfilled with Katsuda's Sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:29.75,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, um... She's a maid who's \Nbeen working for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.75,0:11:33.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So this is the birthplace of Katsuda's Sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.41,0:11:35.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm so moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:37.29,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I kinda know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.83,0:11:42.22,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You have moments where you feel \Nthis way, as well, Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:46.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah. Like when I went to see \Na hero show a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:47.56,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs28\fad(1188,1)\an9\fnArial Black\c&H6DBDA9&\3c&H9DFEED&\bord2.5}Garden Park\N{\c&H73B3E9&\fs30}Hero Show!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:53.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You can't help but feel your heart stir when \Nyou see something you love, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:55.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.85,0:12:02.07,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.44,0:12:05.96,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,The tonkatsu's ready. You want it cut, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.96,0:12:07.99,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.75,0:12:10.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Look, Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.84,0:12:13.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Though his hands tremble with age,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:16.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,enough to make holding a blade dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.08,0:12:20.10,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The moment he slices through the tonkatsu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.12,0:12:27.60,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,the tremors stop, and he wields his \Nweapon with the utmost precision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.13,0:12:32.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I didn't expect him to cut it \Nso evenly at that age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.62,0:12:34.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What kind of training has he undergone?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:36.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Could he be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.12,0:12:40.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I-Is he the legendary assassin \Nwho is known to reside in Japan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:43.45,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's fangirling hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.32,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Hm? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.32,0:12:50.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,O-Oh, nothing. It's just, our maid is a \Nhuge fan of Katsuda's Sauce. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.80,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,I see, I see. I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.84,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,I'm the one who makes the sauce, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:03.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So you are the god behind this miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.44,0:13:10.08,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Well, my husband came up with the recipe. \NI just produce it, sorry to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:12.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Katsuda's Sauce is super popular, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.78,0:13:15.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Your fried dishes are so \Ncrispy and amazing, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.61,0:13:18.90,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Is that so? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:22.86,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,U-Um, I... I wanted to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.25,0:13:24.74,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:34.25,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Until recently, I'd never considered meals to \Nbe something that could be delicious or fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:39.92,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But the moment that sauce touched my tongue, \Nmy whole world changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.91,0:13:43.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You may think I'm exaggerating,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:48.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but it really was that important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.20,0:13:52.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,When I taste that sauce, \Nwords can't express how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:54.67,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I feel a warmth deep inside my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.97,0:13:58.36,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's why... Please allow me \Nonce again to say...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:02.40,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please accept my heartfelt thanks \Nand respect, Mrs. Fuku Katsuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.90,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Ms. Maid, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:08.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:11.60,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Are you happy right now, Ms. Maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:12.91,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:17.98,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,The warmth you're feeling \Nis that of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:20.29,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,And it might be because of \Nthe happiness you feel now
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:24.01,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,that you were able to realize \Nhow delicious the sauce is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.15,0:14:28.59,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,I can't know for sure, though. \NSorry 'bout that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:31.18,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The warmth...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:37.50,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes... I think you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.53,Default,KATSUDA GRANDPA,0,0,0,,Hey, little miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:50.49,Default,KATSUDA GRANDPA,0,0,0,,You had a little lint on your shoulder. \NOn your shoulder, y'see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,He was able to... sneak up behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:57.71,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,As I thought, Master Katsuda...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,is no ordinary man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:04.51,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, we have \Nsome freshly made sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.51,0:15:05.96,Default,FUKU,0,0,0,,You want a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.37,0:15:06.90,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.53,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, by all means!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:11.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Just a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.42,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.42,0:15:25.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The sauce... It's yummy. The sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.58,0:15:27.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:33.45,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs8\fnTimes New Roman\c&H000000&\3c&H5F4D4B&\bord1.5\pos(386.5,248.5)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:36.41,Default,HITOYOSHI AND YUKI,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:41.85,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll handle the washing up, so please \Nget some rest, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:43.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:58.72,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,When I see how happy Ms. Yuki is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:02.23,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,it's hard to believe she was once \None of the most powerful assassins...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.73,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,184)\fs20\blur0.2\c&H5C605C&\frz24.53\pos(244.5,139.5)}Dragon's Nine      Assassination
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.56,0:16:05.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,1)\alpha&H33&\an7\bord0\blur0.3\p1\pos(16,3)\fscx363\fscy155}m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.56,0:16:05.65,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(195,1)\an7\c&H9B5227&}Dragon's Nine\N\N{\c&H161916&\fs16}The Dragon's Nine is a Chinese legend that\Nrefers to nine children born of a dragon.\NEach child had a different form and personality,\Nand each resided in a place that best suited\Ntheir nature, but none could ever become\Na dragon like their parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.13,0:16:09.82,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,As I expected, the only results \Nare about Chinese folklore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:15.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Sh-Should I just ask Ms. Yuki herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.57,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Oh, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:19.80,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,she might have reasons \Nto not want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:20.87,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And, besides that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.30,0:16:24.04,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Though she may have tried \Nto put her painful past behind her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.44,0:16:26.75,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,it might not be something \Nshe can so easily forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:30.83,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I wouldn't want to reawaken any trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.83,0:16:34.90,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It'd be best if I waited for Ms. Yuki \Nto share her past with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:36.91,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.00,0:16:42.73,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,And yet, I still want to know more about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.33,0:16:48.82,Flashback,HITOYOSHI MOM,0,0,0,,Yoshi... Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:52.55,Flashback,HITOYOSHI MOM,0,0,0,,We can see each other anytime, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:56.35,Flashback,HITOYOSHI MOM,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's my fault that \Nthings are the way they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:16:59.36,Flashback,HITOYOSHI MOM,0,0,0,,I have to go, okay, Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.70,0:17:02.76,Flashback,CHILD HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't go, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.76,0:17:05.62,Flashback,HITOYOSHI MOM,0,0,0,,We'll see each other soon, Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:11.08,Flashback,CHILD HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't leave me, Mom! Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.55,0:17:14.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.95,0:17:21.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:25.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You were groaning, so I came to check on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:30.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You suddenly fell towards me, \Nso I caught you at once, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:34.96,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,S-Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.44,0:17:38.24,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was kinda... having a weird dream, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.65,0:17:41.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Were you dreaming of your mother again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.59,0:17:43.02,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:44.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,how about resting your head on my lap?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.44,0:17:48.58,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're real fond of that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.02,0:17:52.17,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Nope! I'm already wide awake, so I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:55.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What's this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:57.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.35,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,You were researching the Dragon's Nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.35,0:18:01.31,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:02.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are you curious about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:04.45,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,J-Just a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:08.39,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was just thinking I didn't know \Nmuch about you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's true. Well, as for the Dragon's Nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.88,0:18:17.03,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I don't know \Nthat much about them either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.50,0:18:21.88,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was taken in by my mentor \Nand brought into the clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:26.00,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but even after joining, all I did \Nwas follow my mentor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.71,0:18:31.64,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I've only even laid eyes on \Na few of the other members,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:35.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,and I never found out their names or had \Nthe opportunity to speak with any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.96,0:18:39.39,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's not that she doesn't want to talk, \Nbut that she just doesn't know, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.39,0:18:44.09,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Unlike now, back then it was all \NI could do just to stay alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,so I had little interest in other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.14,0:18:52.81,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I started to lose sight of what \NI was doing and why I was doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.25,0:18:59.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My only worry was being abandoned \Nfor disappointing my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.76,0:19:07.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's why I still haven't grown \Naccustomed to all this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:11.37,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The birds chirping, the sunlight shining \Nthrough the gaps in the curtains...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:16.61,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,They're all such little things in life, \Nbut they sparkle so brilliantly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.92,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't get over how wondrous it all is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:18.92,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&H979797&\3c&HF7FDFC&\pos(373.5,119)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.73,0:19:24.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Sometimes I feel like I'm still dreaming, \Nand I just haven't woken up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.95,0:19:28.33,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's how brightly this world shines for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.47,0:19:32.97,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,But when I see your face, Master Hitoyoshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:44.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm able to remind myself that right now, \NI'm just a girl learning how to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.09,0:19:51.08,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the day when this \Nlifestyle becomes second nature to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:56.75,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's when I'll truly be able \Nto call myself normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,M-Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.71,0:20:02.84,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Every morning when I see \Nyour face, I feel at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.39,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It made me really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,that after everything that happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:10.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,you still chose to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.14,0:20:13.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's why I wanted to get to know you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So, uh, anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thank you so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:23.28,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,for coming... here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:26.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:32.79,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you something new about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:36.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The reason I love having you \Nrest your head on my lap...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.47,0:20:44.19,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,is because it reminds me of the very first \Ntime I was able to do something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:48.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,So whenever you have another bad dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I'll always be here to lend you my lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.32,0:20:54.59,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um... That's... Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:57.83,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:00.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Then I'll tell you something about me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:05.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,The truth is, the dream I had just now \Nwasn't really a bad one, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.67,0:21:08.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What kind of dream was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.75,0:21:11.79,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Instead of my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:23.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I had a dream about a hero \Ncoming to get me, I guess.
